## Architecture summary

- HistoryRetriever maps port role/text → autor/texto/timestamp; drops bot/unknown
- ContextRetriever deterministic formulas from history only; injectable clock
- ScheduleRetriever.fuente = "no_implementado"; still registered for resolve
- build_default_registry boot-resolves PLANNER_CAPABILITY_UNIVERSE
- Director production: prefer no change; blast tests only

